__NOTOC__
On August 8, 9 and 10, the second tournament for the title of champion in the DUEL and 2on2 nominations according to TQA - "Invasion" was held in Tyumen.
This time, the tournament had a solid prize fund for the duel nomination, and a more modest one for the 2on2 nomination.

The tournament was memorable for a huge number of interesting games and unexpected results. Perhaps the main event was the games from team '''Circuz''' ({{Player|Camperoid|flag=ru}} & {{Player|Gorgoroth|flag=ru}}), they passed DE bracket one step away from elimination in each match.

